        "code_body": "```c\n// 实现2\nint i, N;\ncin >> N;\nint tnt = 0, tmp;\nfor (i = 1; i < N + 1; i++) {\n    tmp = 1;\n    for (int j = 1; j < i + 1; j++)\n    tmp *= j;\n    tnt += tmp;\n}\ncout << tnt << endl;\n```",
